# US-0106/DEC-0106 Sovereign Role-Behavior Manifest

## Trigger Conditions

When `SOVEREIGN_ROLE_MANIFEST=1` (set in merged scratchpad), the sovereign role manifest at
`.cursor/sovereign-role-manifest.yaml` is active. Default-off (`=0` or unset) means zero overhead.

## Schema Contract

YAML v1 schema requires 6 top-level sections:
- `schema_version: 1`
- `roles[]` — array of role definitions
- `review_obligations[]` — array of inter-role review obligations
- `allowed_self_overrides[]` — array of allowed self-override dimensions (verbosity, detail_level, tone)
- `cross_model_policy` — mapping with `default_order` (role_review_first, critic_first, critic_only, role_review_only)
- `escalation_rules` — mapping with `rework_max` cap

## Role Contract

Six role IDs: `po`, `tech-lead`, `dev`, `qa`, `release`, `curator`.

Each role has an `objective_function` (string, max 512 chars by default, configurable via
`SOVEREIGN_ROLE_OBJECTIVE_MAX_CHARS`). The objective is injected into role-specific context.

## Review Obligation Contract

Each obligation specifies:
- `obligation_id` (unique)
- `reviewer_role`, `target_role` (from valid role set)
- `trigger_phase` (from valid phase set)
- `review_focus` (user_value_drift, testability, buildability, deployability)
- `artifact_refs` (list)
- `blocking` (boolean)

Per-phase cap: `SOVEREIGN_ROLE_REVIEW_MAX_PER_PHASE` (default 2).

## Security Guard

Objective functions must not contain secret-shaped literals (api_key, token, password, secret,
private_key patterns). Failure → `SOVEREIGN_ROLE_SECRET_DETECTED`.

## Compose Guards

US-0106 is additive on top of US-0069 spawn machinery. Review spawns are supplementary
post-phase hooks — they never substitute for the US-0069 producer role.

US-0106 must not alter:
- US-0069 phase→role matrix (phase→role mapping unchanged)
- US-0104 sovereign_critic schema (critic JSONL schema unchanged)

## Validation

Validate with: `python scripts/sovereign_role_manifest_validate.py --repo .`

## Reason Codes

- SOVEREIGN_ROLE_MANIFEST_DISABLED
- SOVEREIGN_ROLE_MANIFEST_SCHEMA_INVALID
- SOVEREIGN_ROLE_UNKNOWN_ROLE
- SOVEREIGN_ROLE_UNKNOWN_PHASE
- SOVEREIGN_ROLE_SECRET_DETECTED
- SOVEREIGN_ROLE_OBJECTIVE_OVERFLOW
- ROLE_REVIEW_DISPATCH_FAILED
- ROLE_REVIEW_SPAWN_FAILED
- ROLE_REVIEW_BLOCKED
- ROLE_REVIEW_DEFERRAL_FAILED
- ROLE_REVIEW_REWORK_CAP
